{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/9574f5ac6814f554b95ce9e78250e91f.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=800 height=473 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/9574f5ac6814f554b95ce9e78250e91f.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About Shop Crush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your Thrift Shop. <strong>Sell</strong> a hodgepodge of merch to picky customers. <strong>Set</strong> the <strong>prices</strong>, <strong>bargain</strong> with clients, and turn down suspicious offers. <strong>Order</strong> popular stock, <strong>fight</strong> off shoplifters, and <strong>manage</strong> your reputation \u2014 gain or lose it based on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/6175e89fd0c7de24487e3ada848cb510.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Own a Thrift Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you <strong>own</strong> a <strong>Thrift Shop</strong>! Clients visit daily to purchase their preferred products. To keep your business profitable, you must <strong>monitor</strong> your <strong>prices</strong> and the\u00a0demand for your\u00a0<strong>products</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/46672b16fa47b6ffc754c9e79b8c3899.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this\u00a0<i>choice-driven</i>\u00a0<strong>Visual Novel</strong>, you must\u00a0<strong>balance</strong>\u00a0the profitability of the offer with the reputational loss that every purchase can cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7b3bd1c2cb5a7047e1c8e99bd1f0de1e.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7b3bd1c2cb5a7047e1c8e99bd1f0de1e.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7b3bd1c2cb5a7047e1c8e99bd1f0de1e.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/92df7f1d5a1b97eecaf4311f1441673e.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find New Buyers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4cea0e44518aca01524685aa32a44758.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect</strong> with different <strong>customers</strong> and help them find what they want. Every customer has a unique <strong>personality</strong>, purchasing <strong>patterns</strong>, and <strong>preferences</strong>. Build <strong>relationships</strong> with your favorite customers, give them the best deals, and try to keep up with their <i>needs</i>, <i>demands</i>, and <i>wishes</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/260db2faa7b0d0cf94c19daac22b66b6.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/260db2faa7b0d0cf94c19daac22b66b6.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/260db2faa7b0d0cf94c19daac22b66b6.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4fdf8e6930d2a2068d88fb35a2abca0d.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Buy New Products and Refill the Supply</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order</strong>\u00a0new stock in the catalog. Keep your\u00a0<strong>shelves</strong>\u00a0<strong>stocked</strong>\u00a0so your buyers have what they need. Some products are <strong>popular</strong> with specific buyers but not in demand by others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Selling</strong> common goods, like <i>milk</i>, will get you a safe income, while <strong>risking</strong> selling sin goods will <strong>cash you out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control</strong> the customer's <i>rage</i> to protect your shop's reputation. If your <strong>reputation</strong> is low, people will avoid your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/acd0d6a71071fa984acb9914f206dcaf.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/acd0d6a71071fa984acb9914f206dcaf.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/acd0d6a71071fa984acb9914f206dcaf.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/179c363414f0b464047a33cd75763e9f.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enhance and Personalize</strong>\u00a0<strong>Buyers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up</strong>\u00a0Your\u00a0<strong>Customers</strong>\u00a0to Improve Their\u00a0<strong>Purchasing Power.</strong>\u00a0Customers improve their\u00a0<strong>Visit Frequency</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Average Check</strong>, and <strong>Reputation</strong> at every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select</strong> a character's <strong>skin</strong> <i>(gender)</i> you like, and change it whenever you want during the game. There are three skin types supported: <i>alien</i>, <i>female</i>, and <i>male</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customers</strong> have <strong>preferences</strong> for their favorite and least <strong>favorite goods</strong> they want to buy from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c0b712e69296705b1a0786252bb193d9.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c0b712e69296705b1a0786252bb193d9.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c0b712e69296705b1a0786252bb193d9.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/3b51eedb99e6e7dab512192ed078da1d.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the Literal Illusions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoom</strong>,\u00a0<strong>rotate,\u00a0</strong>and\u00a0<strong>drag</strong>\u00a0the hidden pictures to uncover your customers' secrets. Every buyer has a\u00a0<strong>Literal Illusion Puzzle</strong>\u00a0connected to their persona. <strong>Complete</strong> all the puzzles to discover the horror your shop is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4bbdd81fc83c48da8b19eaf74d24b370.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4bbdd81fc83c48da8b19eaf74d24b370.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4bbdd81fc83c48da8b19eaf74d24b370.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Key Features and Contents</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-based</strong> <i>Card Game</i> with tense and procedurally generated <strong>Core Gameplay</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Shop Simulator</strong> and an\u00a0<i>Economy</i> game about trading with <strong>Customers.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Atmospheric\u00a0</strong><i>Visual Novel</i>\u00a0about insanity, doubt, and <strong>Reality Check</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative</strong> <i>Puzzle Game</i> based on the\u00a0<strong>Literal Illusion Effect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>10 Unique Clients</strong>, each with their own tastes and shopping styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>5 Selected locations</strong> with carefully crafted storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Levels</strong> to Upgrade Every Customer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>70+ Products to buy</strong> - from weird ones to essentials!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet the Customers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/522de9f674928da10f2f789bf6da92d3.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Leslie, a Poor Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A poor customer who usually buys trash. Sometimes, you may get a good offer from them. You will always have a small profit if you sell them cheap stuff for a tiny margin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong> Rubber Ducks, Bananas, Mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Daily Care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/507096fc5379be6b2b297ada3113c185.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chelsea, a Rich Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This customer has a preference for shiny items and may be willing to overpay for them. If you balance profit and reputation, you may succeed. If you decline to serve Chelsea, your shop's reputation will improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Brand Clothes, Vegan Products, Animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Empty Shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/d8fd8725d26c8e05592ef91c1f20f809.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Brinley, a Coupon Collector</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Coupon Hunter customer. Likes good deals and cheap items. Brinley guarantees you a small margin of income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong>\u00a0Discounted Groceries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong> Full-Priced Arrivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c938aa720c266c5601050af5109a1aee.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Zoe, an Authentic Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly passionate customer with unique values. Zoe likes people who agree with them. If you agree, Zoe might give you generous payback regarding profits and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong>\u00a0Obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates: </strong>Everything that's not essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/0b6878c03d4457735283bd1da4b533c1.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Casey, an Enforcer Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inspector playing their own game. They might confiscate some of your items, demanding a fine. If you refuse to pay, it will save you money, but not your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong> High-value home essentials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Refusal to cooperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/e16c5f0c35f3a56a4f353c69d5151df9.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Alex, a Mayor Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrepreneurs can rarely influence a mayor, though they enjoy good price talks. Negotiations are what made them mayors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Natural Cosmetics, Healthy Food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Mystical Objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/fe5bbcca4731ed615819bb9556e57a74.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nata, a Hacker Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might buy simple groceries to hide the offshore activity. Or make a fake purchase to exploit their taxes. Sometimes, they buy regular geek stuff and threaten to take down your store for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Fun Stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong> ??? ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/dc81c11270af69cc38dce2408b1ee0d8.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sibs, Family Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These sibs only look similar. They have opposite tastes and disagree with each other all day! Because of their unpredictability, they could be valuable clients for either profit or reputation gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like: </strong>Fun and<strong>\u00a0</strong>Parties!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hate: </strong>Consensus and Routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7952675e535f3dc3530721324154c61a.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Kaycey, an Assertive Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prominent therapist and authoritative customer. They know how to manipulate sellers very well. If you refuse to serve them, they will take revenge. Aside from destroying your reputation, they will make you sell extra cheaply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Voodoo Dolls, Talismans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0You?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/1a82a493bf74d53e032ab1cf59552641.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mx Malkoff, a Creative Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly intelligent, careful, and delicate buyer. Claire has exquisite taste and expects things to impress them. Claire likes their favorites and is willing to sponsor them greatly. Rare to visit, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong> Violins, Cigarettes, Poetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:\u00a0</strong>Wine and everything that's banal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Who's Your Favorite?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2961120?t=1761691838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761691838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/03b3700067483b0979e535374b6d6a033f791bc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761691838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/03b3700067483b0979e535374b6d6a033f791bc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761691838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Reminder (who's barking there?!)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/0d8d0c3f4bec93b6669a787fcb5d4743.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like the game? Please Wishlist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes. Please let your friends know if you think the game would be a good fit for them or the community. Adding the game to your\u00a0<strong>wishlist</strong>\u00a0can help\u00a0<strong>Shop Crush</strong>\u00a0find more players like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist will also help you better track the news about the game updates, discounts, and free weekends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also press &quot;Follow&quot; to keep up with<i>\u00a0</i>community discussions.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/9574f5ac6814f554b95ce9e78250e91f.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=800 height=473 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/9574f5ac6814f554b95ce9e78250e91f.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About Shop Crush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your Thrift Shop. <strong>Sell</strong> a hodgepodge of merch to picky customers. <strong>Set</strong> the <strong>prices</strong>, <strong>bargain</strong> with clients, and turn down suspicious offers. <strong>Order</strong> popular stock, <strong>fight</strong> off shoplifters, and <strong>manage</strong> your reputation \u2014 gain or lose it based on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/6175e89fd0c7de24487e3ada848cb510.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Own a Thrift Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you <strong>own</strong> a <strong>Thrift Shop</strong>! Clients visit daily to purchase their preferred products. To keep your business profitable, you must <strong>monitor</strong> your <strong>prices</strong> and the\u00a0demand for your\u00a0<strong>products</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/46672b16fa47b6ffc754c9e79b8c3899.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this\u00a0<i>choice-driven</i>\u00a0<strong>Visual Novel</strong>, you must\u00a0<strong>balance</strong>\u00a0the profitability of the offer with the reputational loss that every purchase can cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7b3bd1c2cb5a7047e1c8e99bd1f0de1e.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7b3bd1c2cb5a7047e1c8e99bd1f0de1e.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7b3bd1c2cb5a7047e1c8e99bd1f0de1e.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/92df7f1d5a1b97eecaf4311f1441673e.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find New Buyers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4cea0e44518aca01524685aa32a44758.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect</strong> with different <strong>customers</strong> and help them find what they want. Every customer has a unique <strong>personality</strong>, purchasing <strong>patterns</strong>, and <strong>preferences</strong>. Build <strong>relationships</strong> with your favorite customers, give them the best deals, and try to keep up with their <i>needs</i>, <i>demands</i>, and <i>wishes</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/260db2faa7b0d0cf94c19daac22b66b6.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/260db2faa7b0d0cf94c19daac22b66b6.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/260db2faa7b0d0cf94c19daac22b66b6.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4fdf8e6930d2a2068d88fb35a2abca0d.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Buy New Products and Refill the Supply</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order</strong>\u00a0new stock in the catalog. Keep your\u00a0<strong>shelves</strong>\u00a0<strong>stocked</strong>\u00a0so your buyers have what they need. Some products are <strong>popular</strong> with specific buyers but not in demand by others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Selling</strong> common goods, like <i>milk</i>, will get you a safe income, while <strong>risking</strong> selling sin goods will <strong>cash you out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control</strong> the customer's <i>rage</i> to protect your shop's reputation. If your <strong>reputation</strong> is low, people will avoid your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/acd0d6a71071fa984acb9914f206dcaf.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/acd0d6a71071fa984acb9914f206dcaf.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/acd0d6a71071fa984acb9914f206dcaf.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/179c363414f0b464047a33cd75763e9f.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enhance and Personalize</strong>\u00a0<strong>Buyers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up</strong>\u00a0Your\u00a0<strong>Customers</strong>\u00a0to Improve Their\u00a0<strong>Purchasing Power.</strong>\u00a0Customers improve their\u00a0<strong>Visit Frequency</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Average Check</strong>, and <strong>Reputation</strong> at every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select</strong> a character's <strong>skin</strong> <i>(gender)</i> you like, and change it whenever you want during the game. There are three skin types supported: <i>alien</i>, <i>female</i>, and <i>male</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customers</strong> have <strong>preferences</strong> for their favorite and least <strong>favorite goods</strong> they want to buy from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c0b712e69296705b1a0786252bb193d9.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c0b712e69296705b1a0786252bb193d9.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c0b712e69296705b1a0786252bb193d9.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/3b51eedb99e6e7dab512192ed078da1d.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the Literal Illusions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoom</strong>,\u00a0<strong>rotate,\u00a0</strong>and\u00a0<strong>drag</strong>\u00a0the hidden pictures to uncover your customers' secrets. Every buyer has a\u00a0<strong>Literal Illusion Puzzle</strong>\u00a0connected to their persona. <strong>Complete</strong> all the puzzles to discover the horror your shop is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4bbdd81fc83c48da8b19eaf74d24b370.poster.avif?t=1761691838\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4bbdd81fc83c48da8b19eaf74d24b370.webm?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/4bbdd81fc83c48da8b19eaf74d24b370.mp4?t=1761691838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Key Features and Contents</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-based</strong> <i>Card Game</i> with tense and procedurally generated <strong>Core Gameplay</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Shop Simulator</strong> and an\u00a0<i>Economy</i> game about trading with <strong>Customers.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Atmospheric\u00a0</strong><i>Visual Novel</i>\u00a0about insanity, doubt, and <strong>Reality Check</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative</strong> <i>Puzzle Game</i> based on the\u00a0<strong>Literal Illusion Effect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>10 Unique Clients</strong>, each with their own tastes and shopping styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>5 Selected locations</strong> with carefully crafted storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Levels</strong> to Upgrade Every Customer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>70+ Products to buy</strong> - from weird ones to essentials!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet the Customers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/522de9f674928da10f2f789bf6da92d3.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Leslie, a Poor Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A poor customer who usually buys trash. Sometimes, you may get a good offer from them. You will always have a small profit if you sell them cheap stuff for a tiny margin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong> Rubber Ducks, Bananas, Mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Daily Care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/507096fc5379be6b2b297ada3113c185.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chelsea, a Rich Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This customer has a preference for shiny items and may be willing to overpay for them. If you balance profit and reputation, you may succeed. If you decline to serve Chelsea, your shop's reputation will improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Brand Clothes, Vegan Products, Animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Empty Shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/d8fd8725d26c8e05592ef91c1f20f809.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Brinley, a Coupon Collector</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Coupon Hunter customer. Likes good deals and cheap items. Brinley guarantees you a small margin of income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong>\u00a0Discounted Groceries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong> Full-Priced Arrivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/c938aa720c266c5601050af5109a1aee.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Zoe, an Authentic Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly passionate customer with unique values. Zoe likes people who agree with them. If you agree, Zoe might give you generous payback regarding profits and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong>\u00a0Obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates: </strong>Everything that's not essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/0b6878c03d4457735283bd1da4b533c1.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Casey, an Enforcer Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inspector playing their own game. They might confiscate some of your items, demanding a fine. If you refuse to pay, it will save you money, but not your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong> High-value home essentials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Refusal to cooperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/e16c5f0c35f3a56a4f353c69d5151df9.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Alex, a Mayor Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrepreneurs can rarely influence a mayor, though they enjoy good price talks. Negotiations are what made them mayors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Natural Cosmetics, Healthy Food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0Mystical Objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/fe5bbcca4731ed615819bb9556e57a74.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nata, a Hacker Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might buy simple groceries to hide the offshore activity. Or make a fake purchase to exploit their taxes. Sometimes, they buy regular geek stuff and threaten to take down your store for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Fun Stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong> ??? ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/dc81c11270af69cc38dce2408b1ee0d8.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sibs, Family Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These sibs only look similar. They have opposite tastes and disagree with each other all day! Because of their unpredictability, they could be valuable clients for either profit or reputation gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like: </strong>Fun and<strong>\u00a0</strong>Parties!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hate: </strong>Consensus and Routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/7952675e535f3dc3530721324154c61a.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Kaycey, an Assertive Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prominent therapist and authoritative customer. They know how to manipulate sellers very well. If you refuse to serve them, they will take revenge. Aside from destroying your reputation, they will make you sell extra cheaply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes: </strong>Voodoo Dolls, Talismans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:</strong>\u00a0You?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/extras/1a82a493bf74d53e032ab1cf59552641.avif?t=1761691838\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mx Malkoff, a Creative Customer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly intelligent, careful, and delicate buyer. Claire has exquisite taste and expects things to impress them. Claire likes their favorites and is willing to sponsor them greatly. Rare to visit, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Likes:</strong> Violins, Cigarettes, Poetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hates:\u00a0</strong>Wine and everything that's banal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Who's Your Favorite?</strong></h2>","developers":["Bs1 & Bslteam"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961120/058e4cf30c0e237e776190a932e15bdcd4674a7d/header.jpg?t=1761691838","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) 2025 Bs1 & Bslteam","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"